    "text": "Consider the van der Waal&#39;s constants, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>,</mo></math> for the following gases.<table border=\"1px solid\">\t<thead>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<th>Gas</th>\t\t\t<th><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math></th>\t\t\t<th><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></math></th>\t\t\t<th><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math></th>\t\t\t<th><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></math></th>\t\t</tr>\t</thead>\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>/</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>1.3</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>0.2</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>5.1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>4.1</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>/</mo><mo>(</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>3.2</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>1.7</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>1.0</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math><mn>5.0</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><br />Which gas is expected to have the highest critical temperature?",
